    "title": "Free movie screening Saturday night hosted by Celebrate Laconia - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By GABRIEL PERRY, The Laconia Daily Sun ,\n11 hours ago LACONIA — Celebrate Laconia picked up where the Weirs Drive-In Theater left off for a free movie night on Canal Street. Celebrate Laconia is hosting the screening from 7:30 to 9:30 p.m. on Saturday, Sept. 20. Potential movies to be screened during the event include \"The Goonies,\" \"Harry Potter,\"... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
